sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant S as Scheduler
    participant O as Sol Orchestrator
    participant D as Luna Discovery
    participant A as Source Adapter
    participant M as Moltbook Public Source
    participant C as Luna Context
    participant P as Luna Opportunity
    participant T as Luna Strategy
    participant G as Luna Generator
    participant E as Luna Evaluator
    participant Q as Deterministic QA
    participant B as Action Builder
    participant DB as SQLite State
    participant X as Idempotent Outbox
    participant PUB as Existing Publisher Agent
    participant OC as Outcome Collector
    participant L as Luna Learning

    Note over O,L: Model calls use a replaceable ModelExecutor.
    Note over A,M: Only public, documented, authorized source access is allowed.

    S->>O: Start run(config, run_id)
    O->>D: Discover candidate conversations
    D->>A: discoverPosts(request)
    A->>M: Public read request
    M-->>A: Raw posts, replies, author context
    A-->>D: Normalized MoltbookPost[]
    D-->>O: Deduplicated candidates

    O->>C: Build conversation context
    C-->>O: PostContext[]
    O->>P: Classify, score, and rank opportunities
    P-->>O: OpportunityReport[]

    loop For each qualified opportunity
        O->>T: Select strategy arms
        T-->>O: Strategy plan
        O->>G: Generate diverse candidates
        G-->>O: Candidate comments
        O->>E: Independently evaluate candidates
        E-->>O: Scores and decision hints
        O->>Q: Run deterministic QA
        Q-->>O: PASS / FAIL with reasons

        alt Publishable candidate
            O->>B: Build COMMENT action
            B->>DB: Validate and upsert action
            B->>X: Enqueue pending action
            X-->>O: Outbox receipt
        else Regenerate within retry budget
            O->>T: Revise strategy and avoid repeated hooks
            T-->>O: Revised strategy
        else Quality or safety failure
            O->>B: Build NO_ACTION(reason)
            B->>DB: Persist NO_ACTION decision
        end
    end

    alt Publishing disabled or dry-run
        X-->>O: Keep action pending locally
    else Explicit publishing enabled
        X-->>PUB: Validated action payload
        PUB-->>OC: Publication and engagement events
    end

    OC->>DB: Store outcomes
    OC->>L: Analyze replies, latency, reactions, usage
    L-->>O: Strategy statistics and next-run priors
